  "rawText": "NAME: Camilla Regina Eatmon\n\nDATE OF BIRTH: February 24, 1963\nPLACE OF BIRTH: Washington, D.C.\nMOTHER’S NAME: Erdine Francis Eatmon\nFATHER’S NAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\nBIRTH ORDER: First child of two children\n\nOCCUPATION: Respiratory Therapist\n\nSCHOOL: Prince George’s Community College\n\nRELATIONSHIP: Great Granddaughter\n\nINTERESTS: Working with Boarder Babies and the Big Sisters Organization.\n\nABILITIES: Working with young girls and babies.\n\nLIKES: | would like for more black people to become an organ donor.\n\nDISLIKES: Dishonest people\n\nFAVORITE SAYING: Anybody can be a Mother and a Father, but not everyone can be a Mommy and\nDaddy.\n\nGOALS: My goals are to further my education and to get my second degree in Physical\n\nTherapy. | also would like to see more people get involved in the communities in\nhelping young black boys and girls to overcome drug and alcohol abuse, and to\nearn back the respect for themselves and others.\n\nNAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Jr.\nDATE OF BIRTH: April 14, 1975\nPLACE OF BIRTH: Washington, D.C.\n\nMOTHER’S NAME: Erdine Francis Eatmon\nFATHER’S NAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\nBIRTH ORDER: Second child of two children\n\nOCCUPATION: student\n\nSCHOOL: Bishop McNamara High\nRELATIONSHIP: Great Grandson\n\nINTERESTS: Playing Basketball\n\nABILITIES: Draw (Sketch)\n\nDISLIKES: Filling out this form\n\nFAVORITE SAYING: lf you try and don’t succeed, try again.\n\nGOALS: My goals are to finish High School, and to go on to college and get a degree in\nEngineering.",
  "cleanedText": "NAME: Camilla Regina Eatmon\n\nDATE OF BIRTH: February 24, 1963\nPLACE OF BIRTH: Washington, D.C.\nMOTHER’S NAME: Erdine Francis Eatmon\nFATHER’S NAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\nBIRTH ORDER: First child of two children\n\nOCCUPATION: Respiratory Therapist\n\nSCHOOL: Prince George’s Community College\n\nRELATIONSHIP: Great Granddaughter\n\nINTERESTS: Working with Boarder Babies and the Big Sisters Organization.\n\nABILITIES: Working with young girls and babies.\n\nLIKES: I would like for more black people to become an organ donor.\n\nDISLIKES: Dishonest people\n\nFAVORITE SAYING: Anybody can be a Mother and a Father, but not everyone can be a Mommy and\nDaddy.\n\nGOALS: My goals are to further my education and to get my second degree in Physical\n\nTherapy. I also would like to see more people get involved in the communities in\nhelping young black boys and girls to overcome drug and alcohol abuse, and to\nearn back the respect for themselves and others.\n\nNAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Jr.\nDATE OF BIRTH: April 14, 1975\nPLACE OF BIRTH: Washington, D.C.\n\nMOTHER’S NAME: Erdine Francis Eatmon\nFATHER’S NAME: George Glenn Eatmon, Sr.\nBIRTH ORDER: Second child of two children\n\nOCCUPATION: student\n\nSCHOOL: Bishop McNamara High\nRELATIONSHIP: Great Grandson\n\nINTERESTS: Playing Basketball\n\nABILITIES: Draw (Sketch)\n\nDISLIKES: Filling out this form\n\nFAVORITE SAYING: lf you try and don’t succeed, try again.\n\nGOALS: My goals are to finish High School, and to go on to college and get a degree in\nEngineering.",
